| **Risk assets** ("big money") | ~10% of portfolio — Camillo's personal risk account is "mostly just a Bitcoin ETF and Robinhood stock" |
| **Life expenses** | Never touched — core living expenses are walled off |

### 6.4 Concentration Within the Big Money Account

| Conviction | Allocation |
